iple midi-device elements per MusicXML part. The optional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"id attribute refers to the score-instrument assigned to this device. If missing, the device assignment affects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all score-instrument elements in the score-part."}],"type":"topic"}}}